This email is to let you know we've received your Domestic Intent to Claim. 
Please note shipments within Australia, Qantas Freight is not liable for any loss, damage, delay or penalty which the carrier may incur, as per our <a href ="https://freight.qantas.com/conditions-of-carriagedomestic.html">domestic conditions of carriage</a>. Qantas does not provide transit insurance coverage, which is why we recommend customers source private insurance. </p>

